c_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ADTZGfPSS2YQ7kNvwHakTtl&_nc_oc=AdoONeKODcADE_-hngkQlpo_IKLFnpfw25RgJkxMKD5ObiUfmugTGxxvatlDYsMzL5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9s2TThM5cmHorQv0aqR2xf53uPQvPUCh5_HFTHyGVpnw&oe=6A3163A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "motor grader - trailer cover.png", "id": "840143774838027", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86597262_840143778171360_6047656471363500610_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vlpxWq4VW2oQ7kNvwFtWIwr&_nc_oc=AdrBPAEn-_vsxKws2SEjmY6aXi4_eGwzsN0gWn_P0fw1wFiP3R7FqWr781PTNEdrYs0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9SOjWj0lhh1xwGRerG5f9ngdR7dwn0chdh4JBSUIrQDQ&oe=6A315B50"}, "display_name": "Motor Grader Safety and Operation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Motor graders are versatile machines that play a pivotal role in various projects. Participants will operate a bulldozer and complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of this engaging simulation. \n\n**Overview & Activities:**\n\nParticipants begin with an overview that provides context and helps identify key parts and components outside and inside the vehicle, safety tips, and the basics of a walk-around inspection performed before using any heavy machinery. Participants engage in a sort-and-match activity to reinforce essential controls and their location inside the vehicle. They are then asked to perform a single task to become familiar with operating the vehicle in a VR environment. \n\n**Participant Simulation:**\n\nBefore starting their simulation tasks, participants must wear personal protective equipment (PPE), conduct a walk-around inspection of the vehicle, and complete one task to familiarize themselves with the vehicle's operation. Finally, participants are challenged to complete tasks at an active worksite, including leveling a small hill, moving piles of dirt into targeted areas, and filling a trench with rocks and